  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Sledge Hammer\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Sledge_Hammer.png\" title=\"Sledge Hammer\"><img alt=\"Sledge Hammer\" border=\"0\" src=\"/images/recovered/1h-weapon-_Sledge_Hammer.png\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Damage Type:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Crushing\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Wielding:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">One-Handed\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Attack Speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Normal\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client weapon speed:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">95\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Client damage coeff:&nbsp;</b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">0.87\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>Sledge Hammer</b> is listed on the <a href=\"/wiki/Category/One-Handed-fighter\" title=\"Category:One-Handed-fighter\">One-Handed-fighter</a> weapon list. Stats on this page come from the old weapon lists.</p>\n<p>This weapon also exists in other materials (Cardboard Sledge Hammer, Celestial Sledge Hammer, Default Sledge Hammer, Diamond Sledge Hammer, Iron Sledge Hammer, Obsidian Sledge Hammer, Stone Sledge Hammer, Tin Sledge Hammer, …).</p>\n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
